                  "name": "Adenoviridae",
                  "type": "family",
                  "badges": [
                    "Linear",
                    "Icosahedral"
                  ],
                  "notes": "Adenovirus. Causes febrile pharyngitis, acute hemorrhagic cystitis, pneumonia, conjunctivitis."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Papillomaviridae",
                  "type": "family",
                  "badges": [
                    "Circular",
                    "Icosahedral"
                  ],
                  "notes": "HPV (Warts, Cervical CA, CIN). E6 inhibits p53, E7 inhibits Rb."
